{%- comment -%}
  A set's look, shared by its page's first photo (snippets/set3-stage) and the small packs picture on the compare cards
  (snippets/mega-set-stage): "bg-from,bg-to,word" as step numbers (owner, DECISIONS 314–315). Params: handle, first, last
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case handle -%}
  {%- when 'the-full-ritual' -%}1,2,1
  {%- when 'the-night-ritual' -%}2,3,3
  {%- when 'the-clear-protect-trio' -%}1,2,2
  {%- when 'clear-protect-duo' -%}4,3,2
  {%- when 'the-core-duo' -%}2,1,1
  {%- else -%}{{ first }},{{ last }},{{ first }}
{%- endcase -%}
